1
00:00:00,870 --> 00:00:02,830
(David:)So you and her...?

2
00:00:02,998 --> 00:00:05,168
- No, just neighbors.
- Really?

3
00:00:05,584 --> 00:00:09,254
(David:)I don't know how you live next door to that
without doing something about it.

4
00:00:10,463 --> 00:00:12,213
(Leonard:)Actually...

5
00:00:12,507 --> 00:00:14,887
(Leonard:)...science is my lady.

6
00:00:16,761 --> 00:00:18,721
- Okay. Let's go.
- All right.

7
00:00:18,888 --> 00:00:21,058
(David:)- See you tomorrow, Leonard.
- See you.

8
00:00:21,224 --> 00:00:23,684
(Leonard:)Bye, Penny. Have fun.

9
00:00:28,315 --> 00:00:30,025
SHELDON:
Yes?

10
00:00:37,073 --> 00:00:39,613
(Sheldon:)Did you forget your key?

11
00:00:50,462 --> 00:00:53,802
Well, I don't see anything in here
a woman would want.

12
00:00:54,674 --> 00:00:59,054
(Howard:)You're kidding.
You've got lotions and bath oils and soaps.

